  "pli-tv-kd17:1.2.24": "“Go ahead” renders <i lang='pi' translate='no'>upajānāhi</i>. According to Sp 4.330, <i lang='pi' translate='no'>upajānāhi</i> is just another word for <i lang='pi' translate='no'>jānāhi</i>. Sp-ṭ 4.330 adds: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Jānāhīti cettha paṭipajjāti attho veditabbo</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Jānāhi</i>: and here the meaning ‘undertake’ should be understood.” ",
