  "pli-tv-kd17:1.6.17": "Sp 4.332: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Nānubhavantīti na sampāpuṇanti; tassa dassanaṁ devānampi dullabhanti adhippāyo</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Nānubhavanti</i>: they do not attain; the meaning is that even for the gods seeing him is difficult.” ",
