  "pli-tv-kd17:3.8.21": "Here I follow the PTS edition, which does not have the next two segments. The text means, “The Buddha then said to them, ‘Don’t go back along this path, go along that one.’ And he sent them down a different path”. This seems to be an error in MS based on automatic copying from the previous paragraphs. ",
