  "pli-tv-kd17:3.10.26": "The Pali is rather obscure. Vmv 4.334: <i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sammannatīti cīvarādinā amhākaṁ sammānaṁ karoti, parehi vā ayaṁ satthā sammānīyatīti attho</i>, “<i lang='pi' translate='no'>Sammannati</i>: the meaning is: he creates honor for us by way of robes, etc., or this teacher is being honored by others.” ",
